schema.go transcribes the OOBE configuration key names, value types, handler
sides and behavioural semantics from:

    chrome/browser/ash/login/configuration_keys.{h,cc}
    Copyright 2018 The Chromium Authors
    Licensed under a BSD-style licence:
    https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/LICENSE

The descriptive text in schema.go is rewritten, not copied, but the key names
and the validation semantics are Chromium's design and are reproduced here so
that generated configuration files are accepted by ChromeOS.

ext4.go is an original implementation written against the publicly documented
ext4 on-disk format. Its checksum routines reproduce the algorithms used by
e2fsprogs (crc32c over specific field ranges); no e2fsprogs code was copied.

